B}$)**: The matrix footprint exceeds available free RAM on a 16 GB machine. On Pass 3 and 4, macOS memory compressed swap kicked in, causing pass times to jump from **76.98 ms $\\to$ 2,887.87 ms** ($37.5\\times$ slowdown), dropping sustained bandwidth to **8.56 GB/s**.\n\n3. **Definitive Architectural Limit for 16GB Apple M4**:\n   - **Optimal In-Memory Batch Ceiling**: **100,000 Nodes ($6.8665\\text{ GB}$)** at **89.19 GB/s**.\n   - **Thrashing Threshold**: **$> 125,000\\text{ Nodes}$ ($>8.6\\text{ GB}$)**.\n\n---\n\n## 📜 Canonical Receipts & Audits Committed\n- **True Full-Stream C Source**: [sovra_true_full_stream.c](file:///Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/workspaces/multilang_benchmark/sovra_true_full_stream.c)\n- **Failure Ledger & Telemetry**: [SOVRA_5M_DRAM_FAILURE_LEDGER.json](file:///Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/docs/audits/SOVRA_5M_DRAM_FAILURE_LEDGER.json)\n- **Specification Document**: [SOVRA_5M_SWARM_AND_BEHAVIORAL_TELEMETRY_SPECIFICATION.md](file:///Users/ajoxendine68/Desktop/SSOT_Agentic_Brain/docs/audits/SOVRA_5M_SWARM_AND_BEHAVIORAL_TELEMETRY_SPECIFICATION.md)"}
